<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: title }) %>

    <body>
        <%- include('partials/header', { currentPage: currentPage }) %>

            <main>
                <section class="hero-framed">
                    <div class="hero-frame-wrapper container">
                        <div class="hero-frame">
                            <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_slide_1.jpg"
                                alt="The New Elegance" class="hero-image">
                            <div class="hero-frame-content">
                                <p class="hero-subtext">The</p>
                                <h1 class="hero-headline">NEW ELEGANCE</h1>
                                <div class="hero-cta-group">
                                    <a href="/for-him" class="button button-outline">HIM</a>
                                    <a href="/for-her" class="button button-outline">HER</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="features container">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        Free your <span class="highlight-font">beauty</span> for this season
                    </h2>
                    <div class="features-grid">
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_zoombox_1.jpg"
                                alt="Woman in vintage attire.">
                            <div class="card-overlay">
                                <div class="card-overlay-content">
                                    <span class="offer-text">New offer</span>
                                    <h3>VINTAGE STYLE</h3>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_zoombox_2.jpg"
                                alt="Elegant black skirt and dress.">
                            <div class="card-overlay dark-overlay">
                                <div class="card-overlay-content">
                                    <span class="offer-text">New offer</span>
                                    <h3>SKIRT & DRESSES</h3>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card">
                            <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_zoombox_3.jpg"
                                alt="Fashion model posing.">
                            <div class="card-overlay">
                                <div class="card-overlay-content">
                                    <span class="offer-text">Total sales</span>
                                    <h3>FALL/WINTER 2014/15</h3>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="products container">
                    <h4 class="products-title">
                        New <span class="highlight-font">picked stuff</span> for her
                    </h4>
                    <div class="product-grid">
                        <div class="product-card">
                            <div class="product-image">
                                <a href="#">
                                    <img class="visible-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product1-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Woo Album #1">
                                    <img class="hidden-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product1b-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Woo Album #1 Hover">
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="product-desc">
                                <h4><a href="#">Woo Album #1</a></h4>
                                <span class="price">&pound;9.00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-card">
                            <div class="product-image">
                                <a href="#">
                                    <img class="visible-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product2-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Woo Logo">
                                    <img class="hidden-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product2b-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Woo Logo Hover">
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="product-desc">
                                <h4><a href="#">Woo Logo</a></h4>
                                <span class="price">&pound;15.00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-card">
                            <div class="product-image">
                                <a href="#">
                                    <img class="visible-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_product3-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Woo Ninja">
                                    <img class="hidden-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product3b-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Woo Ninja Hover">
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="product-desc">
                                <h4><a href="#">Woo Ninja</a></h4>
                                <span class="price">&pound;15.00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="product-card">
                            <div class="product-image">
                                <a href="#">
                                    <img class="visible-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product4-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Premium Quality">
                                    <img class="hidden-photo"
                                        src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/home_store_product4b-700x700.jpg"
                                        alt="Premium Quality Hover">
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="product-desc">
                                <h4><a href="#">Premium Quality</a></h4>
                                <span class="price"><del>&pound;15.00</del> &pound;12.00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="cta-secondary container">
                    <div class="cta-text">
                        <h3>Read more <span class="highlight-font">about us</span></h3>
                        <h5>
                            Aenean sollicitudin, lorem quis bibendum auctor, nisi elit consequat
                            ipsum, nec sagittis sem nibh id elit. Duis sed odio sit amet nibh
                            vulputate cursus a sit amet mauris.
                        </h5>
                        <p>
                            Nam nec tellus a odio tincidunt auctor a ornare odio. Sed non mauris
                            vitae erat consequat auctor eu in elit. Class aptent taciti sociosqu
                            ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos himenaeos.
                        </p>
                        <a href="#" class="button button-outline">READ MORE</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="cta-image">
                        <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_about_us.jpg"
                            alt="Stylish woman in black top and white pants.">
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="social-proof container">
                    <div class="brands-container">
                        <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_brand_1_1.png"
                            alt="Arben Brand Logo">
                        <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_brand_2_1.png"
                            alt="DG Grand Brand Logo">
                        <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_brand_3_1.png"
                            alt="Porlatti Brand Logo">
                        <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_brand_4_1.png"
                            alt="Diamond Brand Logo">
                        <img src="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/store/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/home_store_brand_5_1.png"
                            alt="Diavici Brand Logo">
                    </div>
                </section>
            </main>

            <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    </body>

</html>